Description: This path contains the portions of the chromium code used to drive h.264, VP9 and MJPEG decoders. It was
originally forked from c53c9bb7825c3179a7e89607e8520438fb2bf627 and modified to drive the amlogic and VAAPI video
decoders. We have since incorporated all fuchsia-relevant changes up to 3122a68bdc4701c61c8006a110e991df94a43c2c.
Local Modifications: modified to integrate with amlogic and VAAPI video decoders.
